            "reason": "cmd/hooks/acdsl-policy-guard.sh:43 unconditionally denies acdsl/registry.local.json under gated/strict mode. But acdsl/README.md Modes section states the frozen self-management surface is only `policy.json, policy.schema.json, registry.json, evalgen.json` (registry.local.json is not listed), and internal/acdsl/policy.go:139-170 (overlayViolations) authoritatively checks registry.local.json entries against policy.local_overrides — implying it is meant to be a sanctioned, per-target editable overlay, not a frozen file. The hook file is new in this range (git diff shows it added whole). This is a genuine correctness/usability defect (blocks the sanctioned override path) not present in the golden set, distinct from the golden entries on this file (GV3-045 missing test, GV3-068 path-traversal bypass, GV3-125 case-sensitivity bypass, GV3-199 missing Bash-command branch), none of which describe this over-broad denial."
